{"questions":[{"question_id":"m9dqxs7e","content":"<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p><b>Statement I</b>: H<sub>2</sub>Se is more acidic than H<sub>2</sub>Te</p><p><b>Statement II</b>: H<sub>2</sub>Se has higher bond enthalpy for dissociation than H<sub>2</sub>Te</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <u>correct</u> answer from the options given below:</p>","chapter":"periodic-table-and-periodicity","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","isBonus":false,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2025-online-8th-april-evening-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 8th April Evening Shift","permalink":"pgiven-below-are-two-statementsppbstatement-ib-jee-main-chemistry-6ounntl5imu4d6hj","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p><b>Statement I</b>: H<sub>2</sub>Se is more acidic than H<sub>2</sub>Te</p><p><b>Statement II</b>: H<sub>2</sub>Se has higher bond enthalpy for dissociation than H<sub>2</sub>Te</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <u>correct</u> answer from the options given below:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>Both Statement I and Statement II are true</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>Statement I is true but Statement II is false</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>Both Statement I and Statement II are false</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>Statement I is false but Statement II is true</p>"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>To determine the relative acidity and bond enthalpy of H₂Se and H₂Te, let's examine both:</p>\n\n<p><p><strong>Acidic Strength</strong>:  </p>\n<p>The acidity of hydrides increases as we move down the group in the periodic table. This is because the bond strength between hydrogen and the central atom decreases, making it easier for the hydrogen ions to dissociate. Therefore, H₂Te, being further down the group than H₂Se, is more acidic:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.287ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 5872.7 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2464.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3520.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4706.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n<p><p><strong>Bond Enthalpy</strong>:  </p>\n<p>Bond enthalpy refers to the energy required to dissociate a bond. The bond enthalpy decreases down the group due to weaker bonds forming as the atomic size increases. Hence, H₂Se has a higher bond enthalpy compared to H₂Te:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.821ex\" height=\"2.34ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 9645 1034.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(866,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">dis</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2188.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3216.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3772.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4958.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6236.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7292.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(8479,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"39.712ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 17552.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1036.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(2036.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2203.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2481.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(3981.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4148.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">KJ/mol</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7748.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8304.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(9360.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">H</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(10396.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(11562.7,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(11729.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(12007.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(13507.7,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(13674.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">KJ/mol</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(17274.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n\n<p>Thus, H₂Se is indeed less acidic than H₂Te, but it has a higher bond enthalpy for dissociation.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>नीचे दो कथन दिए गए हैं:</p>\n<p>कथन I: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.276ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4983.8 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2186.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2631.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3817.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> से अधिक अम्लीय हे।</p>\n<p>कथन II: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.947ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2186.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> की वियोजन के लिए आबन्ध एन्थेल्पी, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.323ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2352.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> से अधिक है।</p>\n<p>उपर्युक्त कथनों के आलोक में नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सर्वाधिक उपयुक्त उत्तर को चुने: </p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":" दोनों कथन I एवं कथन II सही हैं।\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":" कथन I सही है परन्तु कथन II गलत हैं।\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"दोनों कथन I एवं कथन II गलत हैं।"},{"identifier":"D","content":" कथन I गलत है परन्तु कथन II सही हैं।\n"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>H₂Se और H₂Te की सापेक्ष अम्लता और बंध एन्थैल्पी निर्धारित करने के लिए, आइए दोनों की जांच करें:</p>\n\n<p><p><strong>अम्लीय सामर्थ्य</strong>:  </p>\n<p>आवर्त सारणी में समूह में नीचे जाने पर हाइड्राइडों की अम्लता बढ़ती है। इसका कारण यह है कि हाइड्रोजन और केंद्रीय परमाणु के बीच बंध सामर्थ्य घटता है, जिससे हाइड्रोजन आयनों का वियोजन आसान हो जाता है। इसलिए, H₂Te, जो H₂Se की तुलना में समूह में नीचे है, अधिक अम्लीय है:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.287ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 5872.7 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2464.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3520.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4706.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n<p><p><strong>बंध एन्थैल्पी</strong>:  </p>\n<p>बंध एन्थैल्पी एक बंध को वियोजित करने के लिए आवश्यक ऊर्जा को संदर्भित करती है। परमाणु आकार बढ़ने के कारण कमजोर बंध बनने के कारण समूह में नीचे जाने पर बंध एन्थैल्पी घटती है। अतः, H₂Se की बंध एन्थैल्पी H₂Te की तुलना में अधिक है:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.821ex\" height=\"2.34ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 9645 1034.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(866,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">dis</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2188.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\